                <strong>4.1. Intellectual Property (Our Site):</strong> All content provided by the Site Owner (including the design, logo, code, and site texts, excluding Host Content) is the exclusive property of the Site Owner and is protected by applicable intellectual property and copyright laws.
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong>4.2. Host Content License:</strong> By submitting content (descriptions, photos, etc.) to the Website, Hosts warrant that they own or have the necessary licenses and rights to such content. Hosts grant Us a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license to display, reproduce, and distribute their content on the Website for the purpose of the advertised service.
